    {
      "page_number": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "header_footer",
          "subtype": "header",
          "text": "Dear County Director Letter\nMay 17, 2002\nPage 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "**In addition to the hard copy of this correspondence, a copy will be e-mailed to each county DSS director.** The survey form will appear as an attachment. Each worker should complete a separate form and utilize as many forms as necessary; each form collects information for ten applicants. The data collection tool has characteristic/causal factor information on the far left column; the remaining columns are for recording information on up to ten applicants. Please check one of the categories “Single Parent”, “2 Parent Case” or “Child Only “ and as many other factors specific to that individual/case. Information noted on this tool can also form the basis for an enhanced assessment process as your staff begin to work with these families."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We are specifically asking that each worker record information obtained through the interview process when an application for Work First or Benefit Diversion is taken. It is suggested that an individual responsible for central collection of the data collection tool(s) for each worker be identified."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "For **this survey we are asking that the results of all the individual workers’ survey forms be compiled into one document per county and mailed or e-mailed to Walt Johnson, Assistant Chief, Work First/Local Support by the 10th of July 2002.** We sincerely appreciate your willingness to help us collect this most helpful information. Please contact Mr. Johnson by phone at 919-733-7831 or by e-mail at "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "text": "Walt.Johnson@ncmail.net",
          "url": "mailto:Walt.Johnson@ncmail.net"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": " or contact your Work First Representative should you have questions regarding this request."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Sincerely,"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "description": "A white handwritten signature against a solid black background, which appears to be the inverted signature of Jimmy Carter.",
